轻聊 (Qingliao)
==============

This branch of 轻聊 vendors and adapts Mithka, a Flutter client originally
written to speak TDLib. Mithka's own source and assets remain under the
BSD 3-Clause License; see app/LICENSE (and the copyright holders named
there).

  Mithka: https://github.com/iebb/mithka

The 轻聊 contributors replaced Mithka's TDLib / Telegram network stack
with a pure-Dart adapter for the 轻聊 backend, renamed the Android
application to 轻聊 (applicationId xyz.qingliao.app), and dropped
Telegram branding. Alternative Mithka launcher icons that shipped
upstream are retained as optional Mithka artwork.

Do not assume Telegram, TDLib, or the Mithka authors endorse or are
responsible for 轻聊.
